Cell["\<\
The code for the recursive formula used to determine coefficients used to \
look like this:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978683126632349*^9, 
  3.978683144298769*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"da6c9684-1b20-ac4c-88ae-\
